---
// Component: LocalCaseStudy.astro
---
<!-- 9. RECENT CCTV INSTALLATIONS NEAR LOGAN (WIREFRAME BLOCK 9 - CASE STUDIES) -->
  <section id="projects" class="py-20 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border-y border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
        <span class="text-xs font-black text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-widest px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/50 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800/50">
          Proven Local Evidence
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-3 tracking-tight">
          Recent CCTV Installations Near Logan
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base mt-2">
          De-identified local project case studies showing how we solve real security challenges for residential homes and commercial premises.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        
        <!-- Case Study 1: Logan -->
        <div class="glass-box rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div class="p-7 space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-black bg-blue-500/15 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 uppercase tracking-wider">
                Residential Home
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-400">Completed August 2026</span>
            </div>
            
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              Logan: 2-Storey Executive Residence
            </h3>

            <div class="space-y-2.5 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              <p><strong>Property:</strong> De-identified modern double-storey executive home in Logan.</p>
              <p><strong>Problem:</strong> Blind curved driveway, dark rear patio, and previous package theft from front porch.</p>
              <p><strong>Solution:</strong> 6x 4K PoE Turret Cameras with internal roof cavity cabling and ColorVu full-color night vision.</p>
              <p><strong>Result:</strong> 24/7 full perimeter video with license plate recognition on entering vehicles and instant mobile alerts.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="px-7 py-3.5 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800/80 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>✓ 100% Concealed Wiring</span>
            <span>6 Cameras Installed</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Case Study 2: Logan Central -->
        <div class="glass-box rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div class="p-7 space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-black bg-cyan-500/15 text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-wider">
                Commercial Retail
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-400">Completed July 2026</span>
            </div>
            
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              Logan Central: Retail Shop &amp; Stockroom
            </h3>

            <div class="space-y-2.5 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              <p><strong>Property:</strong> High-turnover food and beverage retail shop in Logan Central.</p>
              <p><strong>Problem:</strong> Stock shrinkage in rear loading dock, disputes at POS cash counter, and lack of off-site managerial access.</p>
              <p><strong>Solution:</strong> 8x 4K Wide-Angle cameras with built-in audio at cash desks and a lockable wall-mount equipment rack cabinet.</p>
              <p><strong>Result:</strong> Owner can monitor store operations remotely on iPad with 45-day continuous recording archive.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="px-7 py-3.5 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800/80 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>✓ Lockable Rack Cabinet</span>
            <span>8 Cameras Installed</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Case Study 3: Springwood -->
        <div class="glass-box rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div class="p-7 space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-black bg-amber-500/15 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-wider">
                System Upgrade
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-400">Completed June 2026</span>
            </div>
            
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              Springwood: Analogue to IP Upgrade
            </h3>

            <div class="space-y-2.5 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              <p><strong>Property:</strong> Family residence in Springwood with an obsolete 8-year-old coaxial setup.</p>
              <p><strong>Problem:</strong> Grainy 720p resolution, dead hard drive, and discontinued smartphone viewing app.</p>
              <p><strong>Solution:</strong> Converted to 4K Digital PoE system utilizing existing conduits with zero wall cut-outs.</p>
              <p><strong>Result:</strong> Crystal-clear digital clarity, reliable remote viewing, and 3-year new equipment warranty.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="px-7 py-3.5 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800/80 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>✓ Existing Conduits Reused</span>
            <span>Zero Wall Damage</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
